  "instructions": [
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a large ramekin over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Add the grated ginger and minced garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the dumplings and cook for 2-3 minutes, until they start to brown.",
    "Add the chopped spinach, diced carrots, bell pepper, and diced tomato.",
    "Stir-fry the vegetables and dumplings for 4-5 minutes, until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Add the cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Continue cooking for another 2-3 minutes, until the flavors are well combined.",
    "Serve the Aromatic Egyptian Dum Stir-fry hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley or cilantro if desired.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
  ],
